Buying a train ticket in France? 🚆🇫🇷 Say THIS

• un aller simple = a one-way ticket
• un aller-retour = a round trip
• une voie = a platform
• un billet = a ticket
• Bon voyage = Have a good trip

💬 Your turn: Un billet pour ___, s'il vous plaît

💌 Save this for your trip
👯 Send it to a friend learning French

